msgctxt "botao_instalar_tudo"
msgid "Install everything"
msgstr "Tout installer"

msgctxt "ajuda"
msgid ""
"Tandem - runs Windows programs, Android apps and Linux packages.\n"
"\n"
"  Formats: .exe .msi  |  .apk .xapk .apks .apkm  |  .AppImage .jar\n"
"           .deb .rpm .flatpakref .snap  |  .sh .run\n"
"\n"
"  tandem                      opens the panel\n"
"  tandem install <file>       installs/runs any of the nine formats\n"
"  tandem preparar             installs what is missing (Wine, Java, Android...)\n"
"  tandem programas [name]     lists and opens the installed programs\n"
"  tandem desinstalar [name]   removes an installed Windows program\n"
"  tandem android              opens the Android screen\n"
"  tandem doctor               diagnosis of the environment (what EXISTS)\n"
"  tandem saude                one health check: what needs attention now\n"
"  tandem autoteste            exercises it for real (what WORKS)\n"
"  tandem repair               reapplies the file associations\n"
"  tandem dados                shows your own files inside Windows\n"
"  tandem dados salvar         copies ONLY your files (quick and small)\n"
"  tandem dados restaurar [c]  puts your files back from a copy\n"
"  tandem backup [where]       saves the Windows environment (a pen drive, say)\n"
"  tandem restore [file]       restores the Windows environment\n"
"  tandem protect <path>       protects a Wine profile from being changed\n"
"  tandem identidade           what a program sees of your machine (licences)\n"
"  tandem portas               pinpad, scale, printer: which COM they landed on\n"
"  tandem portas fixar <p> <d> pins a device to a port (e.g. COM2)\n"
"  tandem servico <folder>     runs a web service and keeps it alive\n"
"  tandem relogio              checks the clock (breaks fiscal, TLS, licences)\n"
"  tandem idioma [code]        which language Tandem speaks (pt_BR en es fr zh_CN hi ar)\n"
"  tandem alternativas <name>  looks for a Linux program that does the same job\n"
"  tandem receita <file>       exports what it learnt, to send to somebody\n"
"  tandem receita --importar <r> <file>      uses somebody else's recipe\n"
"  tandem memoria [name]       what Tandem has learnt about the programs\n"
"  tandem esquecer <name>      erases what it learnt about one program\n"
"  tandem lista                what the community has already worked out\n"
"  tandem lista atualizar      downloads the list (sends nothing of yours)\n"
"  tandem contribuir <file>    builds the line for you to send, if you want\n"
"  tandem enviar [sim|nao]     send what it learns automatically (default: sim)\n"
"  tandem socorro              gathers everything into one file to ask for help\n"
"  tandem logs                 shows the most recent log\n"
"  tandem version              shows the installed version\n"
"  tandem help                 shows this list"
msgstr ""
"Tandem - lance des programmes Windows, des applis Android et des paquets Linux.\n"
"\n"
"  Formats : .exe .msi  |  .apk .xapk .apks .apkm  |  .AppImage .jar\n"
"            .deb .rpm .flatpakref .snap  |  .sh .run\n"
"\n"
"  tandem                      ouvre le panneau\n"
"  tandem install <fichier>    installe/lance l'un des neuf formats\n"
"  tandem preparar             installe ce qui manque (Wine, Java, Android...)\n"
"  tandem programas [nom]      liste et ouvre les programmes installes\n"
"  tandem desinstalar [nom]    supprime un programme Windows installe\n"
"  tandem android              ouvre l'ecran Android\n"
"  tandem doctor               diagnostic de l'environnement (ce qui EXISTE)\n"
"  tandem saude                un bilan de sante : ce qui demande attention maintenant\n"
"  tandem autoteste            l'exerce pour de vrai (ce qui FONCTIONNE)\n"
"  tandem repair               reapplique les associations de fichiers\n"
"  tandem dados                montre vos fichiers dans Windows\n"
"  tandem dados salvar         copie SEULEMENT vos fichiers (rapide et petit)\n"
"  tandem dados restaurar [c]  remet vos fichiers depuis une copie\n"
"  tandem backup [ou]          sauvegarde l'environnement Windows (cle USB)\n"
"  tandem restore [fichier]    restaure l'environnement Windows\n"
"  tandem protect <chemin>     protege un profil Wine contre les modifications\n"
"  tandem identidade           ce qu'un programme voit de votre machine (licences)\n"
"  tandem portas               TPE, balance, imprimante : sur quel COM ils sont\n"
"  tandem portas fixar <p> <d> fixe un appareil sur un port (ex. : COM2)\n"
"  tandem servico <dossier>   lance un service web et le garde actif\n"
"  tandem relogio              vérifie l'horloge (fausse: casse fiscal, TLS)\n"
"  tandem idioma [code]        dans quelle langue Tandem parle (pt_BR en es fr zh_CN hi ar)\n"
"  tandem alternativas <nom>   cherche un programme Linux qui fait la meme chose\n"
"  tandem receita <fichier>    exporte ce qu'il a appris, pour l'envoyer\n"
"  tandem receita --importar <r> <fichier>   utilise la recette de quelqu'un\n"
"  tandem memoria [nom]        ce que Tandem a appris sur les programmes\n"
"  tandem esquecer <nom>       efface ce qu'il a appris sur un programme\n"
"  tandem lista                ce que la communaute a deja trouve\n"
"  tandem lista atualizar      telecharge la liste (n'envoie rien de vous)\n"
"  tandem contribuir <fich>    prepare la ligne a envoyer, si vous voulez\n"
"  tandem enviar [sim|nao]     envoyer automatiquement ce qu'il apprend (defaut : sim)\n"
"  tandem socorro              rassemble tout dans un fichier pour demander de l'aide\n"
"  tandem logs                 montre le journal le plus recent\n"
"  tandem version              montre la version installee\n"
"  tandem help                 montre cette liste"

msgctxt "faixa_de_ate"
msgid "{1} to {2}"
msgstr "{1} à {2}"

msgctxt "envio_aviso_ligado"
msgid ""
"Tandem sends what it learns to the community list.\n"
"\n"
"When you confirm that a program worked, ONE LINE goes out: a fingerprint of the\n"
"program's file, 32 or 64-bit, and which components did the job. Nothing else.\n"
"\n"
"It carries no file name, no folder, no user name, no computer name, no network\n"
"address and no log line. The sieve that guarantees that runs twice.\n"
"\n"
"This is ON. To turn it off, now or ever:\n"
"\n"
"    tandem enviar nao\n"
"\n"
"To see exactly what would go out for one program:  tandem contribuir <file>"
msgstr ""
"Tandem envoie à la liste de la communauté ce qu'il apprend.\n"
"\n"
"Quand vous confirmez qu'un programme a fonctionné, UNE LIGNE part : une\n"
"empreinte du fichier du programme, 32 ou 64 bits, et quels composants ont réglé\n"
"la chose. Rien d'autre.\n"
"\n"
"Elle ne porte aucun nom de fichier, aucun dossier, aucun nom d'utilisateur,\n"
"aucun nom d'ordinateur, aucune adresse réseau et aucune ligne de journal. Le\n"
"filtre qui le garantit tourne deux fois.\n"
"\n"
"C'est ACTIVÉ. Pour désactiver, maintenant ou plus tard :\n"
"\n"
"    tandem enviar nao\n"
"\n"
"Pour voir exactement ce qui partirait pour un programme :\n"
"    tandem contribuir <fichier>"

msgctxt "envio_esta_linha"
msgid "This is the line that is about to go out, in full:"
msgstr "Voici la ligne qui va partir, en entier :"

