msgctxt "instalado_resumo"
msgid ""
"  Tandem installed.\n"
"\n"
"    Double-click a .exe or .msi     -> runs on Windows (Wine)\n"
"    Double-click a .apk or .xapk    -> installs on Android\n"
"    Double-click a .AppImage        -> runs directly, nothing to install\n"
"    Double-click a .jar             -> runs on Java\n"
"    Double-click a .deb             -> installs, checking first\n"
"    Double-click a .rpm             -> explains why it is not for this system\n"
"    Applications menu -> Tandem     -> the panel, with everything\n"
"\n"
"  Check the environment with:  tandem doctor"
msgstr ""
"  Tandem installe.\n"
"\n"
"    Double-clic sur un .exe ou .msi -> tourne sous Windows (Wine)\n"
"    Double-clic sur un .apk ou .xapk-> s'installe sur Android\n"
"    Double-clic sur un .AppImage    -> tourne directement, rien a installer\n"
"    Double-clic sur un .jar         -> tourne sous Java\n"
"    Double-clic sur un .deb         -> s'installe, en verifiant d'abord\n"
"    Double-clic sur un .rpm         -> explique pourquoi il ne sert pas ici\n"
"    Menu des applications -> Tandem -> le panneau, avec tout\n"
"\n"
"  Verifiez l'environnement avec :  tandem doctor"

